### Run these top to bottom with the VS Code "REST Client" extension (humao.rest-client).
@base = http://localhost:8080/api

### 1. Onboard a chain with two properties (a standalone hotel is the same call with one property)
# @name onboard
POST {{base}}/owners
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Coastal Stays",
  "email": "ops@coastal.example",
  "properties": [
    {
      "name": "Sea Breeze",
      "type": "HOTEL",
      "city": "Goa",
      "locality": "Calangute",
      "addressLine": "1 Beach Road",
      "starRating": 4,
      "amenities": ["WIFI", "POOL", "BREAKFAST"],
      "cancellationPolicy": "FLEXIBLE",
      "roomTypes": [
        {"name": "Deluxe", "maxGuests": 2, "totalRooms": 1, "pricePerNight": 2000},
        {"name": "Family Suite", "maxGuests": 4, "totalRooms": 2, "pricePerNight": 4500}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Palm Villa",
      "type": "VILLA",
      "city": "Goa",
      "locality": "Baga",
      "starRating": 5,
      "amenities": ["WIFI", "POOL", "PARKING"],
      "cancellationPolicy": "NON_REFUNDABLE",
      "roomTypes": [
        {"name": "Whole Villa", "maxGuests": 6, "totalRooms": 1, "pricePerNight": 12000}
      ]
    }
  ]
}

### 2. Search
GET {{base}}/properties/search?city=Goa&checkIn=2027-01-10&checkOut=2027-01-12&guests=2&amenities=POOL&maxPrice=5000

### 3. Book the Deluxe room
# @name booking
POST {{base}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "propertyId": "{{onboard.response.body.$.properties[0].id}}",
  "roomTypeId": "{{onboard.response.body.$.properties[0].roomTypes[0].id}}",
  "guestName": "Guest One",
  "checkIn": "2027-01-10",
  "checkOut": "2027-01-12",
  "guests": 2
}

### 4. Same room, overlapping dates -> 409
POST {{base}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "propertyId": "{{onboard.response.body.$.properties[0].id}}",
  "roomTypeId": "{{onboard.response.body.$.properties[0].roomTypes[0].id}}",
  "guestName": "Guest Two",
  "checkIn": "2027-01-11",
  "checkOut": "2027-01-13",
  "guests": 1
}

### 5. Pay (send twice with the same key: same payment comes back, no second charge)
POST {{base}}/bookings/{{booking.response.body.$.bookingId}}/payments
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: pay-001

{"method": "CARD", "details": {"cardNumber": "4111111111111111"}}

### 6. Booking status
GET {{base}}/bookings/{{booking.response.body.$.bookingId}}

### 7. Cancel -> refund per policy, room is searchable again
POST {{base}}/bookings/{{booking.response.body.$.bookingId}}/cancel

### Declined payment example: use card 4000000000000002, UPI "fail@upi" or wallet "fail-wallet"
